  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if keyboard and mouse users were able to change the keyboard controls in the Launch settings. These are the controls that i would like to be added:\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/keyboard-and-mouse\nSome keyboard users like my self have an AZERTY keyboard instead of a QWERTY and it makes it hard to play VRChat properly.\nThanks",
